#. i18n: file ./amarokcore/amarok.kcfg line 395
#: rc.cpp:1834
#, no-c-format
msgid "Draws a shadow around the OSD-text."
msgstr "ដាក់​ស្រមោល​ជុំវិញ​អត្ថបទ OSD ។"

